{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>38歲前TVB「咪神」白雲自上月初認愛22歲德國籍鮮肉機師後，二人於昨日（11月3日）高調飛往毛里裘斯度假瘋狂放閃。期間她突然在社交平台宣佈即將開設付費訂閱直播，憑其過往火辣形象瞬間引發大批網民無限遐想。不過當付費專區真實內容曝光後，一眾以為有大尺度福利睇粉絲頓時大跌眼鏡。</p>\n<h2>白雲偕22歲機師男友同遊毛里裘斯</h2>\n<p>白雲與男友飛抵毛里裘斯展開甜蜜假期，行程相當豐富且充滿視覺震撼。二人換上純白情侶泳裝乘坐遊艇出海享受日光浴，更一同潛入深海與巨型抹香鯨近距離同框暢泳，畫面唯美壯觀。回到陸上後他們乘坐吉普車穿梭叢林探訪野生獅子，在夕陽映照沙灘上上演浪漫「公主抱」，白雲全程緊緊依偎在身形高大男友身旁，舉手投足間充滿熱戀中甜蜜氣息。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376547452823886_19423765306aeab0632e46f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"snowybai_1793528771_4020731471159982008_283568577.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376547452823886_19423765306aeab0632e46f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>付費直播真相曝光白雲親自解畫</h2>\n<p>面對大批粉絲誤以為即將有性感解鎖環節，白雲迅速在社交平台發文揭開謎底。她上載多張與男友合照並親自寫道：「下次訂閱直播 subscribe live 講我們相識的過程🤗」。原來該付費專區並非如外界猜測般主打火辣福利，而是準備大談這段跨國姊弟戀相識經過與甜蜜點滴。她更特意為機師男友開設全新專屬社交帳號，互相標籤以帶動熱度，將這段戀情熱度轉化為流量密碼。</p>\n<h2>白雲揮別5年婚姻勇敢高調認愛</h2>\n<p>回顧感情狀況，白雲於2021年正式結束維持5年婚姻關係，沉寂一時後終於迎來第二春。她於上月初震撼娛樂圈，大方公開與2004年出生德國籍機師相戀消息。雖然這段異國姊弟戀橫跨16年年齡鴻溝，同時需要克服語言及文化差異，但二人感情依然迅速升溫。白雲曾公開大讚這位年輕小鮮肉思想極度成熟可靠，讓她能夠毫無包袱地做最真實自己，完全沉浸在全新戀愛生活之中。</p>\n<h2>網民錯失性感福利直呼中伏爆笑</h2>\n<p>付費訂閱真實用途公開後，網絡上隨即引發熱烈討論。不少原本滿心期待老司機驚覺表錯情，紛紛留言笑指：「以為係咪神福利，點知係純愛放閃台」、「課金去睇你哋放閃，呢波操作太絕！」對於這段充滿話題性戀情，部分酸民曾留下露骨性騷擾及質疑言論，白雲一律採取冷處理態度應對。她選擇不作任何正面交鋒，繼續專注經營自己網上平台及分享旅行生活點滴。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376547770329998_10472423386aeab065ebb91.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"snowybai_1793356408_4019278659834325000_283568577.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376547770329998_10472423386aeab065ebb91.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376548064954806_14647763546aeab0690693c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"snowybai_1793356408_4019278658139638968_283568577.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376548064954806_14647763546aeab0690693c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17937654824986811_2567869486aeab06ae7a83.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"snowybai_1793269172_4018551364777526360_283568577.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17937654824986811_2567869486aeab06ae7a83.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376548675875584_86082146aeab06f1335d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"snowybai_1793269172_4018551374785184081_283568577.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376548675875584_86082146aeab06f1335d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376548938448898_4140455686aeab071a7522.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"snowybai_1793528771_4020731477308784039_283568577.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376548938448898_4140455686aeab071a7522.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376549216893064_3263535056aeab07469876.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"snowybai_1793528771_4020731463761146393_283568577.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376549216893064_3263535056aeab07469876.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179154280187783486_2118822426ac8c61264105.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"白雲 異國戀 （圖片來源：IG@snowybai）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179154280187783486_2118822426ac8c61264105.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T04:25:11.715872+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1235,"images":8,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T04:11:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T04:58:42.582950+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T04:18:51.118126+00:00","content_hash":"120180835a8adb37ed118c1800c2e0ba751ecadb0ff43b04f082b06fb6f179c3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}